Package: propagationoferror
Type: Project
Title: Propagation of Error: Citations to Retracted Research
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ken", "Cor", role = "aut"),
    person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gsood07@gmail.com"))
Description: Reproducible analysis of citations to retracted articles before and
    after retraction, using Retraction Watch for the retraction registry, OpenAlex
    for citation histories and matched never-retracted comparison articles, and a
    2016 Web of Science snapshot for measurement validation.
